# Test-only SCRAM credentials for compose.kafka.secure.yaml and
# tests/kafka_e2e.rs. Nothing real: the broker binds to 127.0.0.1 only. Not
# prefixed KAFKA_, which the image would turn into broker properties.
E2E_SCRAM_USER=tpp-streams-scram
E2E_SCRAM_PASSWORD=scram-e2e-not-a-secret
# Every topic and consumer group this user may touch starts with this.
E2E_SCRAM_PREFIX=sasl-
